@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam activityStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam activityEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M02 — Download settings without link side effects
start
:CF-M02-S01\nInitiating actor\nOwner explicitly requests a\ndownload-configuration change.;
if (CF-M02-S02\nCurrent owner authority for\nintended resume/settings valid?) then (yes)
:CF-M02-S03\nOwner\nSelect\ngenerated/uploaded/both/neither\nand relevant language choices;
:CF-M02-S04\nSystem\nEvaluate actual selected\nartifact/language availability and\npolicy;
if (CF-M02-S05\nConfiguration valid under reviewed\navailability policy?) then (yes)
:CF-M02-S06\nSystem\nSave intended download\nconfiguration only;
if (CF-M02-S07\nSave result confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M02-S08\nSystem\nReport saved mode; link enablement\nand page publication unchanged;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M02-S09\nSystem\nReport failed/partial/unknown\nsave; reconcile effective settings;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M02-S10\nSystem\nExplain invalid or unavailable\noption; do not substitute\nunrelated content;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M02-S11\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
